{"id":"H6019","lemma":"עַמְרָם","transliteration":"amram","sayIt":"am-RAM","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Amram","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Exo.6.18;\nson of: Kohath (H6955);\nbrother of: Izhar (H3324), Hebron (H2275B) and Uzziel (H5816); married to Jochebed (H3115);\nfather of: Moses (H4872), Aaron (H0175) and Miriam (H4813)\nAlso named: am.ra.mi (עַמְרָמִי \"Amramite\" H6020)\n§ Amram = \"exalted people\"\n1) a descendant of Kohath and Levi and father of Moses\n2) one of the sons of Bani who had a foreign wife in the time of Ezra","glosses":["amram","amram’s"],"count":12,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"exo-6","v":18,"renderings":{"bsb":"Amram","kjv":"Amram"}},{"chapterId":"exo-6","v":20,"renderings":{"bsb":"And Amram","kjv":"And Amram"}},{"chapterId":"num-3","v":19,"renderings":{"bsb":"were Amram","kjv":"Amram"}},{"chapterId":"num-26","v":58,"renderings":{"bsb":"Amram"}},{"chapterId":"num-26","v":59,"renderings":{"bsb":"and Amram’s","kjv":"of Amram's"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-6","v":2,"renderings":{"bsb":"Amram","kjv":"Amram"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-6","v":3,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Amram","kjv":"of Amram"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-6","v":18,"renderings":{"bsb":"Amram","kjv":"Amram"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-23","v":12,"renderings":{"bsb":"Amram","kjv":"Amram"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-23","v":13,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Amram","kjv":"of Amram"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-24","v":20,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Amram","kjv":"of Amram"}},{"chapterId":"ezr-10","v":34,"renderings":{"bsb":"Amram","kjv":"Amram"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Exodus 6:18","note":"The sons of Kohath: Amram, and Izhar, and Hebron, and Uzziel; and the years of the life of Kohath were one hundred thirty-three years.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Numbers 3:19","note":"The sons of Kohath by their families: Amram, Izhar, Hebron, and Uzziel.","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 6:2","note":"The sons of Kohath: Amram, Izhar, and Hebron, and Uzziel.","source":"we